{"title": "Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath", "pageid": 31060, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Mind-Claw_of_Tu'narath", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> affecting <a href=\"/wiki/Ch%27r%27ai_W%27wargaz\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ch'r'ai W'wargaz\">Ch'r'ai W'wargaz</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>. It allows him to use a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">Legendary action</a> to summons a deadly psionic blade in response to the inquisitor or an ally being attacked.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Twice per round, Inquisitor W'wargaz can spend a Legendary Action to summon a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a> after he or his allies are struck. \n</p><p>When the claw strikes, W'wargaz may <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mindsteal_Link\" title=\"Mindsteal Link\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mindsteal Link\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mindsteal_Link\" title=\"Mindsteal Link\">Mindsteal Link</a> with a target not already affected by this condition.\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">W'wargaz</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Allows use of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath_(class_action)\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp/38px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp/50px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Spiritual_Weapon_Greatsword_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath_(class_action)\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (class action)\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a> twice per turn as a free <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/25px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/38px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/25px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">reaction</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacking a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a> does not trigger this free reaction.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 968/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8276/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5077/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 687908/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.042      1 -total\n 98.90%   32.680      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 35.40%   11.698      2 Template:SAI\n 32.77%   10.829      2 Template:Icon_link\n 31.54%   10.421      2 Template:Icon_text\n 27.94%    9.233      6 Template:Trim\n 21.54%    7.118      2 Template:Ifempty\n 13.68%    4.521      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.81%    4.234      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.15%    4.013      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31060-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201947 and revision id 325580. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}